WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.020
Surprise!

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.500
Bonus Thursday video on my channel.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.640
Feel both offended

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.120
and excited.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.200
This is a bonus video this week.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.040
For two reasons..

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:10.760
One..

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.640
I have purchased this

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.680
family fun make-up kit..

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.740
Thinking I was gonna do

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:16.740
some sort of..

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.360
funny, hilarious uh

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.640
Halloween

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.820
make-up tutorial type of thing.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.240
And instead I made a video about

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.420
how to be a Disney princess daughter.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.660
But right after I shot that video,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.880
I was seeing all these make-up tutorials..

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.220
about how to make yourself into

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.080
uh, an emoji.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.520
And I realized no one was making themselves

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.200
into my favorite emoji.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:39.980
Which..

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:40.860
is this.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.360
*mumbling*

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.760
I wanna give him space.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.180
It's the old man emoji.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.160
And so I thought today

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.460
I would try to make myself into the old man emoji.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.040
Some of you will probably

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.380
wanna be this for Halloween

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:58.800
because it's gonna be great.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.400
No, how can you live up to--

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.460
How can you live up to that?

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.760
Why am I even trying this?

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.980
And the second reason that

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.140
I'm doing this video

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.140
is because I am part of the Ad Council's new campaign

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.460
I Am a Witness.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.380
An anti-bullying campaign,

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:19.540
which I am really excited that they even asked me to be a part of.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.000
The I Am a Witness campaign

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.280
is launching today!

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.760
October 22nd.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:24.800
Talking about bullying

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:25.320
sucks.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.840
Because I think we've all been bullied.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.840
I think talking about bullying is a great way

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:33.000
to kinda take the power out of bullying.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.100
You know, the more you say

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.940
one word over and over again

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.900
the less meaning it has in your brain.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.060
And with that, the Ad Council has

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.120
created an Anti-Bullying campaign

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.480
centered around an emoji

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.320
not the old man emoji.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.900
I know. I know, but that would be a weird message

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.620
and wouldn't be direct and would take a lot of explanation

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:53.240
Instead they chose this.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.560
The purpose of the eye emoji

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.000
is to use it when you are a witness to something.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:01:59.820
"Eye" Am a Witness

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.060
Send it to the bully or the bullied..

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.940
through a text message or through social media

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:06.400
however it makes sense to you..

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.900
to just let them know you see what's happening.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.120
I will put all the links

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:11.820
in the description box below

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.520
that you would need if you are interested

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.560
in this campaign.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.200
And I hope you are because

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:16.780
I am.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.380
And use the eye to let people know you are

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.120
a witness.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.880
Or recreate this old man emoji face..

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.300
Halloween tutorial.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.300
And then just saddle up to the bullies

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.600
when they least expect it.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.260
Maybe in a dark alley when they're all alone..

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.020
maybe in their rooms when they're sleeping..

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.900
and just wake 'em up

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:33.740
a little bit and

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.080
then say,

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.720
"No one will believe you this is happening."

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.460
"Stop being awful..."

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.600
"to everyone else and this will stop."

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.220
If that seems like a lot

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.920
to do maybe just download the keyboard.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.060
Grace VO: So before we officially begin..

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.380
we're gonna brush out our dirty, gross hair

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.680
into a ponytail.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.680
So that we can foreseeably put it under a bald cap.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.020
But we don't have a bald cap

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.460
so we can just put it in a ponytail

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:00.900
and pretend.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.600
If you can get your hands on a bald cap,

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:03.460
congrats!

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.440
Stop bragging.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:07.880
But we couldn't, so I'm gonna use a nude tanktop instead

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.060
I'm gonna replace it over my hairline

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.440
like a bald cap

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.160
Be impressed by how great it looks for a second

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.500
then go back to being terrified that I'm actually

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.120
putting a tutorial on my channel.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.420
I'm gonna tie it in the back

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.980
and we find that it looks terrible in the back

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.600
because you only see me from the front

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.720
You go out in the real world

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.240
you  might want to fix the back.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.640
Then I'm going to poorly handle

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.800
some foundation.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.120
And then try to blend it into my face

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.340
to blend my fake bald cap

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.700
into my fake facial coloring.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:42.700
Which I don't know that any of this is actually helping.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.240
I think I just wanted to pretend I was a beauty guru for like a second..

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.680
doing something with coloring.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.440
I think I might be color blind.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:51.200
I then tried to use concealer

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.520
to blend in my eyebrows

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.460
and quickly realized that concealer

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.940
does not blend in your eyebrows.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.420
So watch other beauty gurus to figure out how

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.620
to blend in your eyebrows.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.400
Then I got to use my make-up kit

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.420
that I bought after

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.620
I turned it right side up.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:06.080
And I tried to use some of the colors in there

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.560
to blend in eyebrows

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.840
and quickly learned

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.100
I just don't know how to do it.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.720
Maybe watch someone like Kandee Johnson..

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.660
So then I moved onto pouring old

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:14.700
timey dust all over my face.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.600
AKA setting my foundation with

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.860
translucent powder.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.100
From there, I moved onto bronzing

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.200
my face because when you look at this emoji

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.380
the entire outline of his face is very tan.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.560
And contoured.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.220
This man is retired.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.660
And living in--

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.560
he is not alive.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.500
Which is important to recognize.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.840
After this, I messed around with my lighting set up a bunch.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.640
Like I knew what I was doing.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.240
I continued to contour my face.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:44.120
Like I was a beauty guru on an actual mission.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.640
Rather than a solo Lewis and Clark

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.560
just trying to get by.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.880
Then I took an eyebrow pencil

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.620
and decided to draw the three prominent

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.620
wrinkles on the old man emoji

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:55.760
forehead.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.560
And took a look at myself and realized

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.220
this is actually working out.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.760
Absolutely nothing can go wrong from here.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.360
And then grab the black pencil from the Halloween

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.120
makeup kit.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.600
Draw the oversized smiley mouth and realize

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:08.800
I hated it.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.800
So I used instead the black face paint

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.300
from the Halloween make up kit.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.360
And realized oh my gosh!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.860
So I just submitted to my own terribleness

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.020
and drew the two shaded lines that

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.060
come down from the old man emoji's mouth.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.980
Then I went through a very long series

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.280
of trials and tribulations.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:28.040
I--well, tribulations on tribulations..

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.720
of trying to make larger cartoonish emoji eyes..

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.340
using white face make up

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:33.620
and black eye shadow

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.640
black eyeliner before ultimately realizing

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.640
I'm not capable of this!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.240
So again, watch Kandee Johnson.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.120
I took off all the terrible tries off my eyes

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.160
and just went with some plain foundation

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.780
covered eyes with some black eyeliner

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.280
in the corner trying to make the eyes pop.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.900
Then I moved onto making the grey tufts

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.240
of hair that the emoji has.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.680
I took some cardboard

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.000
and cut it into two half circles.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.820
and covered it in duct tape

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.840
to get the grey color and

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.720
duct taped it to the side of my head

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.980
in a very crude alien, elderly Minnie Mouse like fashion..?

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.300
I went back through and tried to fix

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.540
the mouth with some liquid eyeliner

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:08.680
and there you go.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.560
The creepy..

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.320
It wasn't supposed to be creepy!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.660
But it is definitely creepy!

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:16.940
Old man emoji..

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:18.300
Halloween costume.

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.880
I hope on some level this made you want

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.520
to download the "I'm a Witness" keyboard

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.500
for Ad Council's

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.060
"I'm a Witness" anti-bullying campaign.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.120
I don't know.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.700
*music*

